<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικραίνω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικρᾰδ-κραιαίνω</span></b> ,
			3sg.
		fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικρᾱνεῖ</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ag.</u>
			1340
		</span></i> codd.(anap.): aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έκρᾱνα</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έκρηνα, -εκρήηνα</span>(v. infr.):—
			Med.
		, 3pl.
		aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεκρήναντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					14.297
				</span></i>
			:<i>—bring to pass, accomplish</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρὴν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν ἐπικρήνειε</span>
			<i>may</i> he <i>fulfil</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.599
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ σφιν ἐπεκραίαινε</span> he
				<i>fulfilled</i> it not for them,<i><span class="en">
				3.302
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.419
			</span></i> (v.l.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άαινε</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῦν μοι τόδδ᾽ ἐπικρήηνον</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐέλδωρ</span>
			<i>grant</i> me this prayer, <i>fulfil</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				1.455
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦθον ἐπεκρήηνε</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρήατι</span> by a nod, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					624
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀληθῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					887
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάμου πικρὰς τελευτάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					744
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποινὰς</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1340
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριν ἀντ᾽
			ἔργων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1546
			</span></i> (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1468
			</span></i>(anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archyt.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσῷ δ᾽ ἐπὶ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείλεα κεκράαντο</span>
			<i>were finished off</i> with gold, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.132
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				616
			</span></i>.</div>
